{"id":"71233b52551503c6","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-dlo-quantifier-elimination.md","title":"DLO has Quantifier Elimination","display":"thm-dlo-qe — DLO has Quantifier Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-dlo-quantifier-elimination","aliases":["57-thm-dlo-quantifier-elimination"],"display":"thm-dlo-qe — DLO has Quantifier Elimination","depends_on":["[[57-df-dlo]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-total-order]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-dlo-quantifier-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-dlo-quantifier-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dlo-qe — DLO has Quantifier Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"DLO-has-Quantifier-Elimination\">DLO has Quantifier Elimination</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_&lt;\">\\(S_&lt;\\)</span> 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，没有常量及函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；两结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 解释均满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a> 的严格全序条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}\">\\(\\mathrm{DLO}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NoEnd}\">\\(\\mathrm{NoEnd}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_&lt;}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_&lt;}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_{S_&lt;}\">\\(\\mathrm{QF}_{S_&lt;}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>。固定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>。由于纯序语言没有闭项或原始真值常量，允许消去后用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\doteq z\">\\(z\\doteq z\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(z\\doteq z)\">\\(\\neg(z\\doteq z)\\)</span> 表达恒真或恒假，故允许这个辅助自由变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 对开公式使用全称赋值语义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(|\\mathfrak A|,&lt;^{\\mathfrak A})\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(|\\mathfrak A|,&lt;^{\\mathfrak A})\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a> 的严格全序谓词，参数依次为结构载体及其二元关系解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_&lt;}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{z\\}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(|\\mathfrak A|,&lt;^{\\mathfrak A})\\land\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_&lt;}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{z\\}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{TotalOrder}(|\\mathfrak A|,&lt;^{\\mathfrak A})\\land\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{NoEnd}(\\mathfrak A)\n\\to\\mathfrak A\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里只修正定理前提，不重定义密度谓词，也不向原语法偷偷加入 ⊤、⊥。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"DLO-has-Quantifier-Elimination","text":"DLO has Quantifier Elimination","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-dlo","status":"resolved","id":"59981a2d27254902","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-dlo]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-quantifier-free","status":"resolved","id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb299